    "finding": "Team-level RS vs playoff PPP by play type (25 teams, min 30 possessions per cell, no CIs): DRIVE PPP was 1.198 in the regular season and 0.912 in the playoffs (-0.286). PNR was -0.173, PULL_UP +0.301, others within -0.07. Recorded as motivating a playoff DRIVE exclusion."
